{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34278","headline":"句曲山朝真词二首 送真 · 陆龟蒙","name":"句曲山朝真词二首 送真","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萦云凤髻飘然解，玉钺玄干俨先迈。\n朝真弟子悄无言，再拜碧杯添沆瀣。\n火{金灵}跳跃龙毛盖，脑髪青青赮綷綷。\n万象销沈一瞬间，空余月外闻残佩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}